sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant E as Cloudflare Edge
  participant A as Transaction API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as SNS and SQS
  participant M as Go Matcher
  participant C as Sepolia
  B->>E: command plus idempotency_key
  E->>A: x-request-id
  A->>D: state plus outbox plus audit
  D-->>A: commit
  A-->>B: accepted plus request_id
  A->>Q: relay versioned event
  Q->>M: event plus request_id
  M->>D: idempotent match result
  B->>C: signed transaction(request_ref)
  B->>A: tx_hash plus request_id
  A->>C: verify receipt and event
  A->>D: reconcile confirmed state
